x;\">62</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":62,\"repo\":\"hanshuebner/bknr-datastore\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> - a CLOS-based lisp-only database in RAM with transaction logging persistence. <a href=\"https://www.common-lisp.net/project/bknr/html/documentation.html\">Manual</a>. <a href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html\">licence</a>.\n<ul>\n<li>see also this <a href=\"https://ashok-khanna.medium.com/persistent-in-memory-data-storage-in-common-lisp-b-k-n-r-37f8ae76042f\">good introductory blog post</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>","updatedAt":"2021-08-09T10:16:50.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"CodyReichert/awesome-cl","categoryHTML":"<h2>Web project skeletons and generators</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vindarel/cl-cookieweb\">cl-cookieweb</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/vindarel/cl-cookieweb\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">8</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":8,\"repo\":\"vindarel/cl-cookieweb\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> - a  Cookiecutter template to start a web project. <a href=\"https://directory.fsf.org/wiki/License:BSD_3Clause\">BSD_3Clause</a>. Not in Quicklisp.\n<ul>\n<li>Provides a working toy web app with the Hunchentoot web server, easy-routes, Djula templates, styled with Bulma, based on SQLite, with migrations, an example table definition and a test suite using FiveAM.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>","updatedAt":"2021-08-09T09:51:59.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"CodyReichert/awesome-cl","categoryHTML":"<h2>Web project skeletons and generators</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/container-lisp/make-like\">make-like</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/container-lisp/make-like\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">7</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":7,\"repo\":\"container-lisp/make-like\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> - an application template builder for LIKE (Lisp In Kubernetes + Emacs) applications. <a href=\"https://directory.fsf.org/wiki/License:ArtisticLicense2.0\">Apache2.0</a>.\n<ul>\n<li>Makefile, podman support, GitHub Actions, Prometheus metrics support, TOML-style config.ini, easy-route preconfigured with health-check and more.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>","updatedAt":"2021-08-09T09:51:59.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"CodyReichert/awesome-cl","categoryHTML":"<h2>Web project skeletons and generators</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/rajasegar/cl-webapp-seed\">cl-webapp-seed</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/rajasegar/cl-webapp-seed\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">5</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":5,\"repo\":\"rajasegar/cl-webapp-seed\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> - a simple web application boilerplate. Uses Hunchentoot, cl-who, deploys easily to Heroku. <a href=\"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT\">MIT</a>.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-08-09T09:51:59.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"CodyReichert/awesome-cl","categoryHTML":"<h2>Web applications examples</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/screenshotbot/screenshotbot-oss\">screenshotbot-oss</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/screenshotbot/screenshotbot-oss\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">63</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":63,\"repo\":\"screenshotbot/screenshotbot-oss\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> - a Screenshot Testing service. This code powers <a href=\"https://screenshotbot.io\">https://screenshotbot.io</a>.\n<ul>\n<li>uses Bknr.datastore as the datastore. Heavy use of their <a href=\"https://github.com/moderninterpreters/markup\">markup</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/moderninterpreters/markup\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">27</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":27,\"repo\":\"moderninterpreters/markup\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> library (JSX-like).</li>\n<li>Closures as URLs (<a href=\"https://github.com/screenshotbot/screenshotbot-oss/blob/main/src/nibble/nibble.asd\">nibble</a>, not yet a standalone library). \"Essentially, it allows me to create \"anonymous\" HTTP endpoints that evaluate a lambda. We integrate it with markup to make it pleasant to write multi-page web forms and flows. e.g. <a href=\"https://github.com/screenshotbot/screenshotbot-oss/blob/main/src/screenshotbot/dashboard/api-keys.lisp#L84\">Here's a flow</a> that lets you delete an API key, but before deleting it it asks you for a confirmation.\"</li>\n<li>user auth and sessions.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>","updatedAt":"2021-08-09T09:51:59.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"CodyReichert/awesome-cl","categoryHTML":"<h2>Others</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/cl-wget/cl-wget\">cl-wget</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/cl-wget/cl-wget\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">4</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":4,\"repo\":\"cl-wget/cl-wget\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> - Makes retrieving large files or mirroring entire websites easy. <a href=\"https://directory.fsf.org/wiki/License:ArtisticLicense